{
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.AcceptCupAndGive": "You accept the cup and give it a careful sniff. Who knows what the phouka put in this stuff? The smell reminds you of some scents from the old general store back home. You try some and find it remarkably smooth for something supposedly cooked up from bog water and peat. The black bunny gives you a crooked smile and settles down next to you, pouring out some more of the powerful spirits."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.AtFirstBaby": "At first, you feel your baby struggle against the whiskey, then it seems to grow content and enjoy it."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.ByTheTime": "[pg]By the time you and the phouka have drunk half the bottle, both of you are feeling a lot better."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.CanHandleYour": " It seems you can handle your liquor better than the phouka."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.LooksLikePhouka": " It looks like the phouka is holding his liquor about as well as you are."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.OhItTastesSoGood": "[pg]Oh, it tastes so good. This stuff just slides down your throat."
  // 原版 PhoukaWhiskey.hx:138 phoukaWhiskeyExpires()
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaWhiskey.ExpiresVeryDrunk": "<b>The dizzy sensation dies away and is replaced by a throbbing pain that starts in your skull and then seems to run all through your body, seizing up your joints and making your stomach turn. The world feels like it's off kilter and you aren't in any shape to face it. You suppose you could down another whiskey, but right now that doesn't seem like such a good idea.</b>\n"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaWhiskey.ExpiresDrunk": "<b>The fuzzy, happy feeling ebbs away. With it goes the warmth and carefree feelings. Your head aches and you wonder if you should have another whiskey, just to tide you over</b>\n"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaWhiskey.ExpiresSober": "<b>The fuzzy, happy feeling ebbs away. The weight of the world's problems seems to settle on you once more. It was nice while it lasted and you wouldn't mind having another whiskey.</b>\n"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.QueasyWantTo": "You feel queasy and want to throw up. There's a pain in your belly and you realize the baby you're carrying didn't like that at all."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.QuicklyEndUpDrunk": "[pg]You quickly end up drunk and begin a rambling story about your adventures. The phouka is a good listener, though he asks for lots of detail whenever you bring up sex or potential sex of any kind. You realize you're in real trouble, turned on and watching the phouka stroking his cock, which is still hard despite the alcohol he's been downing. He notices your interest and says [say: Now that you're relaxed, let's go for the main course. I'll make sure you'll remember it even once you're sober.]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.SoonBothStart": " Soon both of you start to share stories about your adventures in Mareth."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkAccept.WarmFeelingBelly": "A warm feeling in your belly lets you know your passenger enjoyed the meal as well."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkLeave.CouldTakeAdvantage": " you could take advantage of the phouka's predicament, but right now you'd rather go and check on the portal. Thanks to the whiskey, the water soaking your [legs] doesn't matter to you quite so much as you slog back towards camp."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkLeave.IfBitHornier": "[pg]If you were a bit hornier"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkLeave.IfYouWanted": "[pg]If you wanted"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkRefuse.BeginToExtract": "[pg]You begin to extract yourself from the bog. As you do you feel the net of roots and vines rubbing against your body. A little sex with this shapeshifter to tide you over might just hit the spot."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkRefuse.DamnPrude": "[say: You damn prude. That does it! I don't have to sit around listening to this. I try to be friendly like some people say ya should instead of just raping ya. What's it get me, huh?]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkRefuse.RabbitMorphSitsHeavily": "The rabbit morph sits down heavily on the wet ground and sips his booze. [say: Don't want to fuck, don't want to drink. What gives? Live a little and let me have fun with your pregnant pussy. I'll get ya off, and it's not like I can knock you up again. Course, that'd be fun too.]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkRefuseAfterOffer.LooksDisappointedDowns": "The phouka looks disappointed but downs one of the cups and says [say: How come chicks that're knocked up are always such stick in the muds?] He starts to sip the second cup, looks over at you and chuckles. [say: I guess in yer case you've got a good excuse--ye are stuck in the mud!] The phouka keeps drinking and it isn't long before he starts to reminisce."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkRefuseLeave.ExtractFromMud": "You extract yourself from the mud and get out of the bog before the phouka changes its mind."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkRefusePregnantLeave.BlackBunnyWaves": "[say: Ah fuck. You're a killjoy. Don't you know the best time to get porked is when you've already got a bun in the oven?][pg]The black bunny waves you away dismissively. [say: Fine, yeah, go home. I hope the little bastard hurts when it pops out. I would have stretched you out but good.]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.AlcoholSettingDeeper": "[pg]With the alcohol setting in deeper, he derails into calling the faeries his cum slut cousins and several stories revolve around one or more phouka getting faeries utterly drunk before taking advantage of them. He says it's a shame the faeries don't fall for 'stealth booze' anymore."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.AskWhatThey": "[pg]You ask the phouka what they do to breed. Does one phouka shapeshift into a woman so she can carry a child?"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.BeginningToSwell": ", [eachCock] beginning to swell{0}."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.DrinkAnotherCup": "[pg]As you drink another cup of whiskey the phouka topples over, utterly drunk. You've been feeling the effects but your drinking buddy is done."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.FaeriesAre": "[pg]He tells you that faeries are supposed to be born out of special flowers after a \"magicy sparkly fucken ritual\". [say: When the demons came they didn't like that faeries was so pure and chaste that they didn't even fuck to make babies.] His face breaks into a wide smile as he says, [say: Little did they know, faeries always had all the right parts for carrying babies, just needed another fae to knock 'em up.]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.FromTheStories": "[pg]From the stories he tells you learn the phouka were once quite sober and took to guiding settlers on how to survive the mucky and sodden land. People would see them as good omens even in passing. The phouka scoffs as he relays the history, remarking [say: Bunch of fucken spirit guides, wastin' time on brick-headed dullards.]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.GrabsAndShakes": "[pg][say: Anyways, best thing that ever happened was one of those demons used its brains for more than screwing for a while. I don't know what perverted recipe it came up with, but they used that an' made a few of us real fucken vigorous.] The phouka grabs and shakes his crotch as he expounds on his point. [say: I mean real fucken testosteronic, if y'know what I mean, {0}.] You believe you get the point."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.HardestPart": "[pg]He tells you the hardest part is finding wood to make the barrels to age the whiskey in. Those 'bitchy butterflies' in the forest don't like it when the phouka cut down trees."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.LaughsButSense": "[pg]The phouka laughs, but you sense it's not an entirely happy laugh. [say: That don't quite work, not that we haven't tried.] He reclines a bit more and takes another sip before continuing. [say: We've tried all sorts o' potions and such. No dice. Two phouka just can't make a baby. The closest we ever got was when one o' the phouka spent three days poopin' out those little colored eggs. Handy for some things, but no baby. Nah, the only way we make more phouka is by trappin' an' raping faeries. That's why we're so good at it! An' I think some o' them get to like it. Even when we knock 'em up they might get away an' purify themselves with faerie dew or that super sweet honey before the baby gets out.] He absentmindedly strokes his cock a few times and says [say: Maybe I have a couple o' daughters out there in the woods. Ya never know.]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.LittleGiggle": " He lets out a little giggle and begins to shrink. Tendrils of black smoke rise from the bunny morph's black {0} as he shrinks back to the size and shape of a faerie."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.LookAtSleeping": "[pg]You look at the sleeping phouka"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.LooksLikeNeedsA": " It looks like he needs a nap and you take that as your cue to get out of here."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.NowadaysSpend": "[pg]Nowadays, they spend a lot of time fucking and trying lots of different potions and herbs in an attempt to improve their recipes for various kinds of alcohol. Originally it was the orcish grog they garnered a taste for, but that was nothing more than a forced attempt to make the only potable bog-water tolerable by mixing rum into it. As they experimented on their own, they came to prefer whiskey, though they brew a number of different concoctions."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.OnceFeelingWarm": "[pg]Once you're feeling warm and cozy despite the dampness of the bog, this phouka starts to tell you more about his faerie cousins. You already know the phouka like nothing more than to rape forest faeries if they can get them alone, but this one goes into more detail."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.PhoukaSomething": "[pg]This phouka seems to be something of a brewer, at least when he's not trapping and raping victims. He tells you about harvesting some kind of white vegetable bulbs that grow in the bog and how they're always on the lookout for lumps of clay and chunks of bog iron to make parts for their stills. Apparently the mucky peat from the bog burns nicely once it's dry, so there's no shortage of fuel."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.SettlesBackDown": "[pg]The phouka settles back down, taking another swig of whiskey before continuing. [say: We tried to share the joys of cock with those stuck up bitches an' all they wanted was to 'cure' us.] The bunny-morph spits that last word out like a curse. [say: 'ta fuck's there to cure? We drink and fuck like no tomorrow now. Anyways, when we find 'em alone, we catch those pint size pretties, we put 'em in a cage, an' we get 'em blind drunk with whiskey. Then we feed 'em rizza root 'til they're bloated up to our size. An' last we pump cum inside 'em until they've got a belly like an apple. It's a sight to see, I tell ya.]"
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.SphincterTwitch": "and you feel your sphincter twitch as your brain thinks about what you could do with this phouka now."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.StartingToMoisten": ", your [vagina] starting to moisten."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.StoriesContinue": "[pg]The stories continue and the phouka gets progressively more and more drunk. Finally he topples over, utterly drunk."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkTalk.WhenBottleRunsOut": "[pg]When the bottle runs out the bunny stands up, nearly falls down again and looks at you with his eyes crossing. [say: Okay, this is good. This is like the parties in the olden days. You stay here, I'll go find sumore booze an' maybe sum buddies o' mine too. Great booze, great party. That's the way!] Then the bunny melts away, {0}slowly contracting and reforming itself as a little black faerie again. He waves and takes off on a dangerous looking spiraling course through the trees.[pg]As the fuzziness from the whiskey begins to fade you realize [if (corruption <= 66) {{it probably isn't the best idea to stick around}}][if (corruption > 66) {{that you could get away if you want to}}]. If your new drinking buddy really does bring back some friends you'll probably experience the kind of 'party' that will make your jaw click when you talk and leave all your holes sore for a week."
