  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkWhilePregnant.OneCraves": " One of them seems to crave the whiskey, but the other is a more normal child."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkWhilePregnant.PutOneHand": "[pg]You put one hand on your belly, about to refuse the drink. Then you realize that yes, this is exactly what your "
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkWhilePregnant.SureSomeElders": " Sure, some of the elders around the village said a beer or some light cider was all right for a woman heavy with child, but you doubt that whiskey would be acceptable. You politely refuse the drink, hoping the phouka won't be offended."
  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaDrinkWhilePregnant.ThinkAboutUnborn": "[pg]You think about the unborn child{0} you're carrying."
