  "Scenes.Phoukascene.PhoukaMasturbating.WanderingThroughBog": "You are wandering through the bog when you hear the unmistakable sound of someone fapping like there's no tomorrow. You sneak up on the small group of shrubs expecting to find an imp who has finally been overcome by his own lust. Instead it's a {0} you see madly jerking off. He grunts and strains but seems unable to finish. With an annoyed look he dives for the bush, grabbing some small ripe berries from a branch. The {1} rubs the berries on his cock until it drips with blue and black fruit juices. He tosses the remains of the fruits to the ground and goes back to wanking.[pg]After another minute or so he finally thrusts his hips forward in mid-air and begins squirting streams of thick gray cum all over the bushes. He produces far more cum than he should be able to for a creature his size. He aims the last several streams directly onto the berries for some reason. By the time he's done the bush looks like it's covered in a layer of off-white frosting.[pg]The {2} gives a satisfied [say: Ha!] and flies off. Glancing at the bush you decide you won't be making any preserves from the fruits in the bog and turn back toward camp."
